  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Initiation Plan aims to develop innovative project concepts that support Viet Nam in navigating its ongoing structural and policy transformations, in alignment with UNDP&#x2019;s Country Programme Document (2022&#x2013;2026) and the Viet Nam UNSDCF Outcome 3 on Shared Prosperity through Economic Transformation. The Plan responds to emerging challenges, including digital transformation, climate change, declining ODA, promoting the private sector and innovation, and growing inequality.</narrative>
  </description>
